<title>HONG KONG: Asian Banking Corp sets US$60 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Asian Banking Corp sets US$60 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger LTCB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASIAN BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$60 MLN  COUPON     6ML+55     MATURITY  5 YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCHED  27.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3	 CALLS	YR 3	 REPLIES   17.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS    NONE	 SALE LMTS  US/UK/HK/S KOREA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	  CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  S KOREA    GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> PAY DATE   28.OCT.96 (TENTATIVE)		SIGNING   22.OCT.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    US$5 MLN    45BP   ALL-IN  70</p>
<p>   CO-MGRS	   US$2-4 MLN  39BP   ALL-IN  68</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK, COMMERCIAL BANK OF KOREA,</p>
<p>		 INDUSTRIAL BANK OF KOREA, KEB INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>		 (AGENT), LTCB ASIA AND WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
